---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Anthony Craythorn Sound Design" description="Melbourne sound engineer and mix engineer specialising in musical theatre, live performance, studio mixing and vocal recording.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Melbourne / musical theatre / studio mixing</p>
        <h1>Sound that pulls you in.</h1>
        <p class="lede">I'm Anthony, a mix engineer and sound designer specialising in live performance and studio mixing.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/studio">Studio services</a>
          <a class="button ghost" href="/listen">Hear selected work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait-card">
        <img src="/images/anthony-headshot.jpg" alt="Anthony Craythorn" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner split">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><strong>Hi, I'm Anthony.</strong></p>
        <p>I'm a mix engineer and sound designer specialising in live performance and studio mixing. My journey started over 20 years ago as a musician; training as a classical pianist I also played guitar in punk bands, and keys in musical theatre pits. That experience taught me what great sound feels like from a performer's perspective, and it fundamentally shaped how I approach sound design today.</p>
        <p>After completing a Bachelor of Fine Arts in Production, I spent the next decade refining my craft across diverse projects, from small indie productions to large-scale commercial musicals. The combination of my performance background and technical expertise shapes how I approach every mix: with a balanced focus on technical excellence and the artistic and emotional vision of the music.</p>
        <p>Ultimately, my goal is to make you feel something, and pull you so far into the mix that you forget you're listening. You're just <em>there</em>.</p>
        <p>When I'm not behind the console, you'll find me with my fiancé and our puppy Margaret, obsessing a little too much over coffee, tackling DIY projects of varying success, or diving deep into a podcast rabbit hole.</p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <img class="card" src="/images/margaret.jpg" alt="Margaret the puppy" />
        <figcaption class="caption">Margaret — 10 months old</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
